the Present Tense and a preposition of time like <span class=\"strong\">at, until, by and from \u2026 to.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use expressions of time like <span class=\"strong\">On Saturdays ...</span>  to say that you do things on a regular basis.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Preposition or Expression of Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I wake up at 7:00 a.m. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"until\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a period of time leading up to a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm in class until 3:00 in the afternoon.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"by\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" at or before\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I should be home by 6:00.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from ... to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the beginning and ending time of an activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have classes from 9:00 to 3:00 every day. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on (Saturdays) ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the same day of the week  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't have classes on Saturdays. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Modals Should, Could, Have to, Must", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modals <span class=\"strong\">should</span>  and <span class=\"strong\">could</span>  to give recommendations or advice. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">could</span> and <span class=\"strong\">should</span>  to show a recommendation -- what is recommendable.<br /><br />You can use <span class=\"strong\">could</span>  to show possibility -- what is possible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">should</span>  to show expectation -- what is expected.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The modals <span class=\"strong\">must</span>  and <span class=\"strong\">have to</span>  show necessity or obligation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommendation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You should make lasagna tonight.   </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommendation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I could make pasta. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommendation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> We could go to a concert this weekend.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expectation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I should be in school by 9 every day.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Obligation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have to wake up at 7:00 a.m. tomorrow.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Obligation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I must arrive on time tomorrow. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a series of lessons", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So what's your first unit in school?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a daily schedule.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "schedule", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the time you do things on a regular basis", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What's your schedule like now that you're in cooking school? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to skip", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not do something you usually do  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't skip any classes!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to expect  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to plan on something happening", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When can I expect you home for dinner?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "attendance   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being present", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Attendance in class is mandatory.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mandatory ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you have to do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is mandatory to attend every class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be late   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to arrive after the planned time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can't be late for class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a list of 5 - 8 daily routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include something that you need to do or should do in your routine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the time of the day (3:00 ...) you do each thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain your routine to a partner. Use prepositions like <span class=\"italic\">at</span>, <span class=\"italic\">by</span>, <span class=\"italic\">until</span> and <span class=\"italic\">from ... to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss how their routines are the same or different than yours.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about my daily routine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about things I need to do or should do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the time of day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss daily routines with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le04ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le04ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "1", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>:  What's your schedule like now, dear?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I have to wake up at 7:00 because I should be in school by 9 every day. I can't be late for class. I'm in class until 3:00 in the afternoon.  <br/>"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "16500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: When can I expect you home for dinner?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I do my homework at the library.  I should be home by 6."}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "25300", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: That sounds good.  Don't skip any classes!  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Of course not!  I must attend all classes. Attendance is mandatory. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: What's your first unit? <br/>"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "38800", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's on Italian food.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: I love Italian food. I could prepare a pasta dish tonight."}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "time": "47500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Or I could make you pasta to practice!  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: I could invite your teacher to try it!  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No thanks!"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le04ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override"